docs {
  # Get TACOTS Exit Detail
  
  Retrieves the full detail of a single TACOTS exit/completion record by its unique identifier. Returns all exit reason, post-programme outcomes, impact assessment, and status fields.
  
  ## Authorization
  Requires `read` permission.
  
  ## Path Parameters
  
  | Parameter | Type   | Required | Description                       |
  |-----------|--------|----------|-----------------------------------|
  | id        | string | Yes      | UUID of the TACOTS exit record    |
  
  ## Response
  
  **`200 OK`** — Returns the complete TACOTS exit record. `firstName` and `surname` are joined from the TACOTS recommendation record via the onboarding link.
  
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "...",
    "data": {
      "firstName": "string",
      "surname": "string",
      "id": "uuid",
      "studentId": "uuid",
      "schoolAttendedDuringProgram": "string",
      "yearOfExit": 2026,
      "exitReason": "string",
      "highestEducationAttained": "string",
      "currentStatus": "string",
      "higherInstitutionName": "string" | null,
      "higherInstitutionCity": "string" | null,
      "higherInstitutionState": "string" | null,
      "employmentType": "string" | null,
      "vocationalSkill": "string" | null,
      "newSchoolName": "string" | null,
      "completedSecondaryElsewhere": "string" | null,
      "programImpactDescription": "string" | null,
      "programImpactRating": 8 | null,
      "additionalSituationInfo": "string" | null,
      "completedBy": "string",
      "submissionDate": "YYYY-MM-DD",
      "updatedAt": "ISO 8601" | null,
      "createdAt": "ISO 8601",
      "deletedAt": "ISO 8601" | null
    }
  }
  ```
  
  ### Response Fields (`data`)
  
  | Field                          | Type   | Description                                                                        |
  |--------------------------------|--------|------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | firstName                      | string | Student's first name (joined from TACOTS recommendation via onboarding).           |
  | surname                        | string | Student's surname (joined from TACOTS recommendation via onboarding).              |
  | id                             | string | UUID primary key.                                                                  |
  | studentId                      | string | UUID reference to the TACOTS onboarding record.                                    |
  | schoolAttendedDuringProgram    | string | School attended while in the programme.                                            |
  | yearOfExit                     | number | Year the student exited the programme.                                             |
  | exitReason                     | string | Reason for exiting the programme.                                                  |
  | highestEducationAttained       | string | Highest level of education attained.                                               |
  | currentStatus                  | string | Student's current status after exit.                                               |
  | higherInstitutionName          | string | Name of higher institution (nullable).                                             |
  | higherInstitutionCity          | string | City of the higher institution (nullable).                                         |
  | higherInstitutionState         | string | State of the higher institution (nullable).                                        |
  | employmentType                 | string | Type of employment if applicable (nullable).                                       |
  | vocationalSkill                | string | Vocational skill pursued if applicable (nullable).                                 |
  | newSchoolName                  | string | Name of new school if transferred (nullable).                                      |
  | completedSecondaryElsewhere    | string | Whether secondary was completed elsewhere (nullable).                              |
  | programImpactDescription       | string | Description of programme impact (nullable).                                        |
  | programImpactRating            | number | Programme impact rating (1–10, nullable).                                          |
  | additionalSituationInfo        | string | Additional situational information (nullable).                                     |
  | completedBy                    | string | Name of the person completing the form.                                            |
  | submissionDate                 | string | Date of form submission (`YYYY-MM-DD`).                                            |
  | updatedAt                      | string | ISO 8601 timestamp of last update (nullable).                                      |
  | createdAt                      | string | ISO 8601 timestamp of record creation.                                             |
  | deletedAt                      | string | ISO 8601 soft-delete timestamp (nullable).                                         |
  
  ## Errors
  
  | Status                      | Description                                             |
  |-----------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------|
  | `400 Bad Request`           | Invalid `id` format (must be a valid UUID).              |
  | `401 Unauthorized`          | Missing or invalid authentication token.                |
  | `403 Forbidden`             | User does not have `read` permission.                   |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Unexpected server error.                                |
}
